{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方表示，元朗警區特別職務隊聯同入境處昨日（22日）於區內展開代號「火石」（FLINTSTONE）的打擊非法賣淫活動行動。執法人員總共拘捕24名內地女子，年齡介乎27歲至57歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><p>據了解，所有被捕女子均持雙程證到港。</p><p>警方表示，元朗警區會繼續加大力度，打擊區內賣淫等非法活動，呼籲市民若發現區內有懷疑非法活動，請與警方聯絡。</p><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕多名涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190094731015753728703928.jpeg/n7it4RLXt0YcwyvScK9ovRCEFyLSOgpCl93ACJfdwAg\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕多名涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕多名涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261023/1190094728645840896321960.jpeg/aqRwoXLsTTzZ_BlLx-lfZOeZa-XNdGZRzG6nMsxupzI\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕多名涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.695986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":226,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:31:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T00:18:15.349106+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:11.526497+00:00","content_hash":"2942452d1fd7c43377a32dd1c28add0cccfe4283b815fd8321e70b85d0842799","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}